				"_note": "An External Training Record is a learner's externally-completed training awaiting verification (title, provider, kind, regulation, completion/validity dates, evidence, verifier, resulting credential) — a request/evidence archetype. Body leads with the record data including verification status (8-wide), a Related panel resolving learner, linked course and resulting credential, and the certificate/evidence as a wide Files leaf (the point of the record). No comms leaves (no linkedTypes). Sidebar keeps metadata + audit-trail as the verification audit.",
